 be nice.\n2. Even turning off no parry cooldown, auto-parry bypasses it anyway and it is really obvious. If you could fix this that would be cool.\n3. The auto-parry is so baitable even on the lowest settings. If you could add auto-dodge instead that would be great!\nOverall though, it is a good script and without a key system is just amazing. Plus, it is like the only good script for this game, everything else is for the lightsaber arena one.","edited":true,"likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-10-17T03:04:34.251Z","liked":false,"disliked":false}]}]}